"<main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-16 flex-1 w-full\"><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#86f5f6] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#86f5f6] rounded-lg p-1 -ml-1\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg> Back to Inter-Campus Fest</a></div><section class=\"space-y-6 text-left border-b border-zinc-800 pb-12 relative\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-[#86f5f6]/10 border border-[#86f5f6]/30 text-[#86f5f6] text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#86f5f6]\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg> CONCEPT NOTE 2026</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase\"><span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#86f5f6] via-white to-[#f5f8a9]\">Decimal Voices | The Next Decimal</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl text-zinc-300 font-medium font-mono border-l-2 border-[#86f5f6] pl-4 py-1\">\u201cThe universe is an absolute totality of Cosmic Precision.\u201d</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 pt-2\"><span>THEME: THE NEXT DECIMAL</span><span>\u2022</span><span>EDITION: COGNIZIUM 2026</span></div></section><section class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#86f5f6] uppercase tracking-widest\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-binary w-4 h-4 text-[#86f5f6]\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\"></rect><rect height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"6\" y=\"4\"></rect><path d=\"M6 20h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M6 14h2v6\"></path><path d=\"M14 4h2v6\"></path></svg> SACRED &amp; FOUNDATIONAL RATIONALES</div><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 font-mono\">Cosmic proportions and divine calibration from sacred scripture.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><blockquote class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-zinc-950/80 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-[#86f5f6]/40 transition-colors space-y-4 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-500 border-b border-zinc-900 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-[#86f5f6] font-bold\">[VERSE // 01 \u2022 MEASURE]</span><span>SURAH AL-QAMAR 54:49</span></div><p class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[#86f5f6] text-right leading-loose tracking-wide pt-2\" dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\">\u0625\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0651\u0627 \u0643\u064f\u0644\u064e\u0651 \u0634\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0621\u064d \u062e\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0646\u064e\u0627\u0647\u064f \u0628\u0650\u0642\u064e\u062f\u064e\u0631\u064d</p><p class=\"text-zinc-200 text-base sm:text-lg italic font-serif leading-relaxed\">\u201cIndeed, all things We created with predetermined measure.\u201d</p><footer class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#f5f8a9] uppercase tracking-wider pt-2 border-t border-zinc-900 flex justify-between items-center\"><span>\u2014 Surah Al-Qamar (54:49)</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-[10px]\">Predetermined Precision</span></footer></blockquote><blockquote class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-zinc-950/80 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-[#f5f8a9]/40 transition-colors space-y-4 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-500 border-b border-zinc-900 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-[#f5f8a9] font-bold\">[VERSE // 02 \u2022 BALANCE]</span><span>SURAH AR-RAHMAN 55:7</span></div><p class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[#f5f8a9] text-right leading-loose tracking-wide pt-2\" dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\">\u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0633\u064e\u0651\u0645\u064e\u0627\u0621\u064e \u0631\u064e\u0641\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0647\u064e\u0627 \u0648\u064e\u0648\u064e\u0636\u064e\u0639\u064e \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0632\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064e</p><p class=\"text-zinc-200 text-base sm:text-lg italic font-serif leading-relaxed\">\u201cAnd the heaven He raised and imposed the balance.\u201d</p><footer class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#f5f8a9] uppercase tracking-wider pt-2 border-t border-zinc-900 flex justify-between items-center\"><span>\u2014 Surah Ar-Rahman (55:7)</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-[10px]\">Universal Equilibrium</span></footer></blockquote><blockquote class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-zinc-950/80 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/80 hover:border-[#86f5f6]/40 transition-colors space-y-4 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-500 border-b border-zinc-900 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-[#86f5f6] font-bold\">[VERSE // 03 \u2022 EXCELLENCE]</span><span>SURAH AS-SAJDAH 32:7</span></div><p class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[#86f5f6] text-right leading-loose tracking-wide pt-2\" dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\">\u0627\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0630\u0650\u064a \u0623\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e \u0643\u064f\u0644\u064e\u0651 \u0634\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0621\u064d \u062e\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0642\u064e\u0647\u064f</p><p class=\"text-zinc-200 text-base sm:text-lg italic font-serif leading-relaxed\">\u201cWho perfected everything which He created.\u201d</p><footer class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#f5f8a9] uppercase tracking-wider pt-2 border-t border-zinc-900 flex justify-between items-center\"><span>\u2014 Surah As-Sajdah (32:7)</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-[10px]\">Perfection in Creation</span></footer></blockquote></div></section><section class=\"space-y-8 border-t border-b border-zinc-800 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase text-white tracking-tight\">The Epistemic Mandate: <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#86f5f6] to-[#f5f8a9]\">Beyond Approximations</span></h2><div class=\"space-y-6 text-zinc-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light\"><p>The universe operates on absolute cosmic precision, not approximations. From galactic orbits and gravitational equilibrium to subatomic interactions and cellular differentiation, everything in nature is governed by microscopic measurements. These calculations never end in an integer; rather, they unfold dynamically across infinite fractional dimensions. Truth resides not in 'rounding off' realities, but in the epistemic curiosity to search for the next decimal.</p><p>In contemporary culture, modern society has fallen into the trap of ignoring microscopic details. Complex human conditions, ethical decisions, and artistic endeavors are routinely flattened into coarse averages and convenient approximations. This is precisely where moral decay begins \u2014 when nuance is discarded in favor of superficial generalizations, and when societal apathy replaces intellectual rigor. To restore balance and moral integrity, we must cultivate the courage to inspect the subtle micro-realities that define our world.</p></div></section><section class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase text-white tracking-tight\">The Primary Academic <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#86f5f6] to-[#f5f8a9]\">Objectives</span></h2><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm font-mono\">Translating cosmic precision into actionable intellectual, analytical, and social disciplines.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800/80 space-y-4 hover:border-[#86f5f6]/60 transition-all group shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#86f5f6]/10 border border-[#86f5f6]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#86f5f6] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-scan w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-zinc-500\">[OBJ // 01]</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#86f5f6] transition-colors\">Information Technology Analytics</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Extract the nuances of truth from information overload. Filter out algorithmic noise to discover subtle, verified signals within massive data streams.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800/80 space-y-4 hover:border-[#f5f8a9]/60 transition-all group shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f8a9]/10 border border-[#f5f8a9]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#f5f8a9] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-brain w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-zinc-500\">[OBJ // 02]</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#f5f8a9] transition-colors\">Intellectual Discipline</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Cultivate scientifically and philosophically precise investigations. Challenge dogmatic assumptions through relentless inquiry and granular proof.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800/80 space-y-4 hover:border-[#86f5f6]/60 transition-all group shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#86f5f6]/10 border border-[#86f5f6]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#86f5f6] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-zinc-500\">[OBJ // 03]</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#86f5f6] transition-colors\">Social Responsibility</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Take minor practical micro-responsibilities seriously. Recognize that systemic integrity begins with individual accountability to the smallest detail.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800/80 space-y-4 hover:border-[#f5f8a9]/60 transition-all group shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f8a9]/10 border border-[#f5f8a9]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#f5f8a9] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-leaf w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-zinc-500\">[OBJ // 04]</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#f5f8a9] transition-colors\">Ecological Interdependence</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">Respect the subtle identities and connections within oneself, society, and the universe. Honor the delicate web of balance that sustains all creation.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"pt-4 pb-12\"><div class=\"p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-center space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-gradient-to-bl from-[#86f5f6]/10 to-transparent rounded-bl-full pointer-events-none\"></div><p class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white leading-relaxed relative z-10 font-serif\">\u201cScroll less. Measure more. The next decimal is where the noise ends and the signal begins.\u201d</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-[#86f5f6] relative z-10\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-[#86f5f6]/10 border border-[#86f5f6]/30\">#DecimalVoices</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f8a9]/10 border border-[#f5f8a9]/30 text-[#f5f8a9]\">#TheNextDecimal</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-[#86f5f6]/10 border border-[#86f5f6]/30\">#CosmicPrecision</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f8a9]/10 border border-[#f5f8a9]/30 text-[#f5f8a9]\">#Cognizium2026</span></div></div></section></main>"